			<div class="content grid grid-cols-8 gap-x-4 m-4">
				<div class="col-span-8 md:col-span-2 mt-2">
					<h2>Freelance web developer with a focus on improving accessibility.</h2>
					<ul role="list" class="list-inside list-disc mt-5 mb-5">
						<li>CMS specialist since 2008</li>
						<li>Lead developer on hundreds of projects</li>
						<li>Digital accessibility specialist</li>
						<li>Front-end development specialist</li>
						<li>Project management specialist</li>
					</ul>
					<p>Recent work has focused on auditing and remediating accessibility issues in CMS-based websites, improving WCAG compliance and overall user experience.</p>
					<p>&nbsp;</p>
					<p>Github: <a target="_blank" href="https://github.com/nahalstead">nahalstead</a></p>
					<p>CV: <a target="_blank" href="/Nick_Halstead_CV.pdf">Download my CV</a></p>
